    "paragraphs": [
        {
            "box": [
                48,
                34,
                358,
                181
            ],
            "contents": "現実的な\n外交·防衛",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 0,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                160,
                180,
                270,
                237
            ],
            "contents": "政策",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 1,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                70,
                256,
                337,
                426
            ],
            "contents": "国際法を重視し、隣国関\n係を安定させ、経済も含\nめた安全保障を確立し\nます。自律的な安保体制\nを議論します。",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 2,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                41,
                464,
                435,
                570
            ],
            "contents": "あなたのための",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 3,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                140,
                569,
                353,
                640
            ],
            "contents": "政治に!",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 4,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                90,
                651,
                407,
                786
            ],
            "contents": "政治資金や選挙制度改革\nで、政治とカネの問題に終止\n符を打ち、あなたのための政\n治を取り戻します。",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 5,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                391,
                31,
                1495,
                173
            ],
            "contents": "稼げる手元に残せる!!",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 7,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                466,
                190,
                1429,
                262
            ],
            "contents": "「もっと稼げて、もっと手元に残せる」生活者ファースト",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 8,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                541,
                302,
                1374,
                352
            ],
            "contents": "成長を促し、税制 を変え、負担 を減らします。",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 9,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                1108,
                411,
                1383,
                470
            ],
            "contents": "社会保険料",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 10,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                486,
                432,
                801,
                503
            ],
            "contents": "本気の減税",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 12,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                488,
                541,
                799,
                711
            ],
            "contents": "食料品消費税ゼロを実現し、\n使えるお金を増やします。\nNISAの掛金を所得税の減\n税対象とし、投資を促し\nます。",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 13,
            "role": null
        },
        {
            "box": [
                1148,
                489,
                1346,
                553
            ],
            "contents": "負担減",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "order": 14,
            "role": "section_headings"
        },
        {
            "box": [
                1098,
                569,
                1404,
                739
            ],
            "contents": "社会保険料負担を減免し、\n子どもの数に応じ将来の年\n金給付を増額する仕組み\nを作り、将来不安を解消\nします。",
